\newlabel{fig:merge}{{4}{4}{Convergent merge. Writers A and B extend the same snapshot $r_0$ independently; whichever order the merges happen in --- and however many times they are repeated --- both replicas reach the \emph {same} root reference, verifiable by comparing hashes. No coordinator, no lock, no conflict dialog}{figure.4}{}}
